{"assets":["/statement-assets/935efff9e191a77a82101174b810fecb0b5837ad9076baccac04bbfdf361869c.png","/statement-assets/cad3c4b0638cc4272b66809914c48c250b6f8636956d62e31ab88e542c6c4f20.png","/statement-assets/0d7f588978b64232e639594b67fc1052d885c94939bf3d5f5a1041e67c8dd205.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"317","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Princess and Her Shadow"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Princess Vlada enjoys springing in the meadows and walking in the forest. One day — wonderful, sunny day — during her walk Princess found out with astonishment that her shadow was missing! \"Blimey!\", — she thought and started her search of the shadow in the forest."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Normally the Shadow is too lazy and simply sleeps under the Princess. But at this terrifically hot summer day she got bored of such a dull life, so she decided to play with Vlada."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The forest, where our characters entertain themselves, may be represented as a set of integer cells in the plane, where the Shadow and the Princess can move only up, down, left and right by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":". Some cells (as it happens in decent forests) are occupied by trees. The Shadow and the Princess are not allowed to enter a cell occupied by a tree. Unfortunately, these are the hard times for the forest, so there are very few trees growing here..."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At first the Princess was walking within the cell ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vx"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vy"},{"kind":"text","text":"), while the Shadow hid from the Princess in the cell ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"sx"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"sy"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The Princess, The Shadow and the trees are located in the different cells."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Shadow is playing with the Princess. As soon as the Princess moves by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" in some direction, the Shadow simultaneously flies by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the same direction, if it is possible (if the cell to fly to is not occupied by some tree); otherwise, the Shadow doesn't move. The Shadow is very shadowy, so our characters do not interfere with each other."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We say that the Shadow is caught by the Princess if after some move both of them are located in the same cell. Vlada managed to catch her Shadow! Can you?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First line of the input contains the coordinates of the characters "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vx"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vy"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"sx"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"sy"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the number of trees "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ m ≤ 400"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the coordinates of the trees."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All the coordinates are integers between -100 and 100, inclusive. The Princess, The Shadow and the trees are located in the different cells."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is impossible for the Princess to catch the Shadow, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise print a sequence of characters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"L"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", corresponding to the Princess's moves, following which she will be able to catch the Shadow at some turn ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"L"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — move to the left, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — to the right, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — up, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — down; axis "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" is directed to the right, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" — up)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The number of characters (that is, the number of moves) must not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"106"},{"kind":"text","text":". All the Princess's moves should be correct, that is must not lead to the cell where a tree grows. It is allowed for the Princess and the Shadow to occupy the same cell before the last turn."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 0 1 0 1\n0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"LLUR\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 0 3 0 8\n2 -1\n2 0\n2 1\n3 -1\n4 1\n4 0\n3 1\n4 -1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 1 1 3\n0 1\n1 0\n0 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"DLL"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Below the pictures for the samples are given (Princess, Shadow and the trees are colored in pink, gray and black correspondingly; the blue dot marks the lattice center)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first case the Princess may make two left steps, one step upwards and one right step: "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/935efff9e191a77a82101174b810fecb0b5837ad9076baccac04bbfdf361869c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the following case the Princess cannot catch the Shadow: "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/cad3c4b0638cc4272b66809914c48c250b6f8636956d62e31ab88e542c6c4f20.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the last sample the Princess may make two left steps and one down step (in any order): "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/0d7f588978b64232e639594b67fc1052d885c94939bf3d5f5a1041e67c8dd205.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"317E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/317/problem/E"}